{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2021-09-01 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMD TO PRESENT AT THE DEUTSCHE BANK 2021 TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF., SEPT. 01, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0TODAY, AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) ANNOUNCED THAT DEVINDER KUMAR, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND TREASURER, WILL PRESENT AT THE DEUTSCHE BANK 2021 TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE ON A VIRTUAL BASIS ON FRIDAY, SEPTEMBER 10, 2021 AT 2:05PM ET/11:05AM PT.\xa0\xa0 A REAL-TIME VIDEO WEBCAST OF THE PRESENTATION CAN BE ACCESSED ON AMD'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE IR.AMD.COM."}